{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the dark, atmospheric soundscape of <i>Worshippers of Cthulhu</i> with this official soundtrack DLC. Featuring 14 original compositions, this collection captures the eldritch tone and tension of the game\u2019s world, blending ambient horror, ritualistic percussion, and haunting melodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're returning to the corrupted forests of the game or simply looking to add some unsettling ambiance to your day, this soundtrack provides a complete musical experience from the cult-infested universe of <i>Worshippers of Cthulhu</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 original tracks created exclusively for <i>Worshippers of Cthulhu</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes in-game music and several unreleased bonus tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provided in both  .ogg and .mp3 formats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible through Steam Music Player and downloadable for personal use</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This soundtrack was composed specifically to reflect the mood, horror, and mystery of the game, and can be enjoyed both as a standalone experience and as a companion to the gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906180?t=1758269126","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906180?t=1758269126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906180/4045286a394b0f096e4beb438d58c83176686f21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758269126","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906180/4045286a394b0f096e4beb438d58c83176686f21/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758269126","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in t